{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y在S11、S12的短时段内，话语和分时感受切分较密，观众可能来不及完整捕捉；X这两段相对凝练。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y通过关键词加亮，让观众扫一眼就能抓住每段叙事的核心，同时把人物的心理变化拆成有先后、有因果的过程，尤其是怀念、委屈、孤独和不甘之间的反复拉扯，比X更容易理解。感受部分又有具体的音乐动作、音色、身体反应和情绪转折，并在相应乐段出现，使细腻感不只是堆砌情绪词，而是能听见、看见人物内心如何变化。整体上Y的叙事主线和音乐感受衔接得更紧，只有少数短时段的信息密度影响扫读。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "476072e4-7d18-4b03-9ecf-0c809005386b", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T012144988327Z", "elapsed_seconds": 38.14, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T01:22:23.132962+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "3c1394ce0c87e13b40b2bd9884144b53256b7bb0b369dd519e49d13808d480db", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\g